    "title": "The Fantastic Four: First Steps - Attend Advance Screening - NewsBreak",
    "text": "nerdtropolis.com\nwebsite\nAustin\nThe Fantastic Four: First Steps – Attend Advance Screening\nBy Moviegoers Society,\n1 days agoWatch The Fantastic Four: First Steps before it hits theaters on July 25, 2025, with an Advance Screening. We are excited to partner with Marvel Studios to offer a Nerdtropolis Advance Screening of The Fantastic Four: First Steps. You can watch this movie before its official release, so grab your complimentary passes now. The film stars Pedro Pascal, Vanessa Kirby, Ebon Moss-Bachrach, Joseph Quinn, and Julia Garner.\n3",
